B.a4y=new A.os("Group 3","under 1,320 lb","under 18,000 ft MSL","under 250 knots","RQ-7B Shadow, RQ-21 Blackjack, V-BAT","Above the 55 lb civil small-drone ceiling in almost every configuration \u2014 civil flight needs certification paths outside Part 107, and NAS access normally runs through FAA authorization (COA) for public/military operations.")
