B.Oo=s(["The DoW source map has landed: 22 mapped entries \u2014 DoD issuances, the Groups 1\u20135 definitions, the public-aircraft / FAA COA path, and each service's stack (Air Force: DAFMAN 11-501/11-502; Army: AR 95-1; Navy: OPNAVINST 3710.7 + NAVAIR flight clearances; Marines: NAVMC 3500.107 + MARADMINs; Space Force: governed under the Air Force stack \u2014 no standalone USSF publications).","Corpus ingest from those public sources is next. Anything the map marks restricted or unread stays a titled placeholder: CAC-gated material is link-out only and is never summarized here."],t.s)
