B.O3=s(['All 50 states now have a researched 13-category drone-law matrix in this app (Browse \u2192 State Regulations), each with its verification date. This summary pulls your state in automatically when the location is entered as a place name (e.g. "Fayetteville, North Carolina") \u2014 raw coordinates don\'t say which state they are in.',"One caution the research keeps proving: state drone law goes stale quietly \u2014 North Carolina's knowledge-test and permit sections were repealed Dec 1, 2024 while the state still printed them. Always check the verified date."],t.s)
